<!doctype html><html lang="id"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Penghapusan Plugin · VendorDomain</title><style>
:root{color-scheme:dark;--bg:#0b1220;--p:#142139;--p2:#0d192b;--line:#2a3c59;--txt:#eef4ff;--muted:#9eafc9;--a:#c4a4ff;--r:16px}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at top left,#1b2d48,#0b1220 58%);color:var(--txt);font:14px/1.55 system-ui}header{padding:20px clamp(16px,4vw,40px);background:#0d1728ed;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}h1{margin:6px 0;font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,36px)}h2{font-size:18px;margin:0 0 8px}p,small{color:var(--muted)}a{color:var(--a);text-decoration:none}.links{display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px}main{max-width:1360px;margin:auto;padding:22px clamp(14px,3vw,34px)}.hero,.work{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 220px;gap:12px;margin-bottom:14px}.card{background:linear-gradient(145deg,var(--p),#101a2d);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);padding:18px}.work{grid-template-columns:220px minmax(0,1fr)}.tabs{display:grid;gap:8px;align-content:start}.tab,button,select,input,textarea{font:inherit;color:var(--txt);background:var(--p2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:10px}.tab{text-align:left;cursor:pointer}.tab[aria-selected=true],button.primary{border-color:var(--a);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--a) 18%,var(--p2))}.view{display:none}.view.active{display:block}.fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px}.field{display:grid;gap:6px;margin:10px 0}.field label{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:.06em}.field input,.field select,.field textarea{width:100%}.actions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:14px}button{cursor:pointer}.preview,.tree,.status{border:1px dashed var(--a);border-radius:12px;padding:14px;background:#0b1729;margin-top:12px}.tree{font:12px/1.8 monospace;white-space:pre-wrap}.status{border-style:solid;color:var(--a)}.json{width:100%;min-height:180px;font:12px monospace}.metric{font-size:26px;color:var(--a);font-weight:700}@media(max-width:700px){.hero,.work{grid-template-columns:1fr}.tabs{display:flex;overflow:auto}.tab{white-space:nowrap}.fields{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style></head><body><header><small>VENDORDOMAIN / MODUL 08 / HALAMAN 178 DARI 500</small><h1>Penghapusan Plugin</h1><p>Konfigurasi berlapis khusus untuk penghapusan plugin.</p><nav class="links"><a href="../features/index.html">Katalog fitur</a><a href="177-instalasi-plugin.html">← Sebelumnya</a><a href="179-aktifkan-plugin.html">Berikutnya →</a></nav></header><main><section class="hero"><div class="card"><small>PUSAT KENDALI MODUL</small><h2>Penghapusan Plugin / Workspace</h2><p>Atur tampilan, pilihan, penerapan, penyimpanan, struktur folder dan parameter teknis.</p><span style="color:var(--a)">6 LAPISAN KONFIGURASI · KONSOL / TEKNIS</span></div><div class="card"><small>IDENTITAS HALAMAN</small><div class="metric">178</div><b>PENGHAPUSAN-PLUGIN</b><p>Profil konfigurasi mandiri</p></div></section><section class="work"><aside class="tabs"><button class="tab" data-tab="layout" aria-selected="true">01 · LAYOUT</button><button class="tab" data-tab="pilihan">02 · PILIHAN</button><button class="tab" data-tab="apply">03 · PENERAPAN</button><button class="tab" data-tab="storage">04 · PENYIMPANAN</button><button class="tab" data-tab="files">05 · SISTEM FOLDER & FILE</button><button class="tab" data-tab="config">06 · KONFIGURASI</button></aside><div>
<div class="view active" id="layout"><div class="card"><h2>01 / Layout</h2><div class="fields"><div class="field"><label>JENIS LAYOUT</label><select id="layoutChoice"><option>KONSOL / TEKNIS</option><option>BENTO / PANEL BERTINGKAT</option><option>SIDEBAR / PANEL</option><option>KONSOL / TEKNIS</option><option>GRID / KOMPONEN</option><option>SPLIT / PRATINJAU</option></select></div><div class="field"><label>KEPADATAN</label><select id="density"><option>Normal</option><option>Ringkas</option><option>Lapang</option></select></div></div><div class="preview" id="layoutPreview">Pratinjau layout Penghapusan Plugin · panel · navigasi · area kerja</div></div></div>
<div class="view" id="pilihan"><div class="card"><h2>02 / Pilihan</h2><div class="fields"><div class="field"><label>AKSEN</label><select id="accent"><option value="#c4a4ff">Warna modul</option><option value="#8bb8ff">Biru</option><option value="#83d6c5">Mint</option><option value="#c4a4ff">Ungu</option><option value="#f0b477">Amber</option><option value="#e89ab4">Rose</option></select></div><div class="field"><label>BENTUK KOMPONEN</label><select id="radius"><option>16</option><option>8</option><option>24</option></select></div></div><label><input type="checkbox" id="hints" checked> Tampilkan petunjuk</label><br><label><input type="checkbox" id="motion"> Transisi ringan</label></div></div>
<div class="view" id="apply"><div class="card"><h2>03 / Penerapan</h2><p>Periksa konfigurasi lalu terapkan ke halaman ini.</p><div class="preview" id="applyPreview">Pratinjau konfigurasi belum diterapkan.</div><div class="actions"><button class="primary" id="applyBtn">Terapkan</button><button id="resetBtn">Pulihkan bawaan</button></div></div></div>
<div class="view" id="storage"><div class="card"><h2>04 / Penyimpanan</h2><p>Profil disimpan pada browser perangkat ini, bukan langsung ke server.</p><div class="field"><label>NAMA PROFIL</label><input id="profile" value="penghapusan-plugin"></div><div class="actions"><button class="primary" id="saveBtn">Simpan konfigurasi</button><button id="exportBtn">Ekspor JSON</button><button id="importBtn">Impor JSON</button><input id="importFile" type="file" accept="application/json" hidden></div><div class="status" id="storageStatus">Belum disimpan.</div></div></div>
<div class="view" id="files"><div class="card"><h2>05 / Sistem Folder & File</h2><p>Struktur penyimpanan yang dirancang untuk modul ini.</p><div class="tree">vendordomain/<br>└── extensions/<br>    └── penghapusan-plugin/<br>        ├── layout/view.config.json<br>        ├── choices/options.config.json<br>        ├── apply/deployment.plan.json<br>        ├── storage/profile.json<br>        └── config/module.config.json</div><div class="field"><label>FOLDER</label><input id="folder" value="vendordomain/extensions/penghapusan-plugin/config/"></div><div class="field"><label>NAMA FILE</label><input id="filename" value="module.config.json"></div><small>Lokasi ini adalah rancangan struktur. Ekspor konfigurasi untuk dipindahkan ke repositori.</small></div></div>
<div class="view" id="config"><div class="card"><h2>06 / Konfigurasi</h2><p>Parameter modul dalam format JSON.</p><textarea class="json" id="json" spellcheck="false"></textarea><div class="actions"><button id="validate">Validasi JSON</button><button id="format">Rapikan JSON</button></div><div class="status" id="configStatus">Siap.</div></div></div>
<div class="status" id="globalStatus">Perubahan belum diterapkan.</div></div></section></main><script>
(()=>{const key="pb-ext-178-config",$=id=>document.getElementById(id),defaults={layout:"KONSOL / TEKNIS",density:"Normal",accent:"#c4a4ff",radius:"16",hints:true,motion:false,profile:"penghapusan-plugin",folder:"vendordomain/extensions/penghapusan-plugin/config/",filename:"module.config.json"};let s={...defaults};function collect(){return {module:"penghapusan-plugin",page:178,layout:$("layoutChoice").value,density:$("density").value,accent:$("accent").value,radius:$("radius").value,hints:$("hints").checked,motion:$("motion").checked,profile:$("profile").value,folder:$("folder").value,filename:$("filename").value,updatedAt:new Date().toISOString()}}function sync(){ $("json").value=JSON.stringify(s,null,2);$("layoutPreview").textContent="Pratinjau: "+s.layout+" · "+s.density+" · "+s.accent;$("applyPreview").textContent=JSON.stringify(s,null,2)}function load(){try{s={...defaults,...JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(key)||"{}")}}catch(e){}$("layoutChoice").value=s.layout;$("density").value=s.density;$("accent").value=s.accent;$("radius").value=s.radius;$("hints").checked=s.hints;$("motion").checked=s.motion;$("profile").value=s.profile;$("folder").value=s.folder;$("filename").value=s.filename;sync()}document.querySelectorAll(".tab").forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{document.querySelectorAll(".tab").forEach(x=>x.setAttribute("aria-selected",String(x===b)));document.querySelectorAll(".view").forEach(v=>v.classList.toggle("active",v.id===b.dataset.tab))});["layoutChoice","density","accent","radius","hints","motion","profile","folder","filename"].forEach(id=>$(id).addEventListener("change",()=>{s=collect();document.documentElement.style.setProperty("--a",s.accent);document.documentElement.style.setProperty("--r",s.radius+"px");sync()}));$("applyBtn").onclick=()=>{s=collect();document.documentElement.style.setProperty("--a",s.accent);document.documentElement.style.setProperty("--r",s.radius+"px");$("globalStatus").textContent="Konfigurasi diterapkan pada tampilan halaman."};$("resetBtn").onclick=()=>{localStorage.removeItem(key);s={...defaults};load();$("globalStatus").textContent="Pengaturan bawaan dipulihkan."};$("saveBtn").onclick=()=>{s=collect();localStorage.setItem(key,JSON.stringify(s));$("storageStatus").textContent="Tersimpan di perangkat · "+new Date().toLocaleString("id-ID");$("globalStatus").textContent="Profil lokal berhasil disimpan."};$("exportBtn").onclick=()=>{s=collect();const a=document.createElement("a"),u=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([JSON.stringify(s,null,2)],{type:"application/json"}));a.href=u;a.download="penghapusan-plugin-config.json";a.click();URL.revokeObjectURL(u)};$("importBtn").onclick=()=>$("importFile").click();$("importFile").onchange=async e=>{try{s={...defaults,...JSON.parse(await e.target.files[0].text())};localStorage.setItem(key,JSON.stringify(s));load();$("storageStatus").textContent="Impor berhasil."}catch(e){$("storageStatus").textContent="JSON impor tidak valid."}};$("validate").onclick=()=>{try{JSON.parse($("json").value);$("configStatus").textContent="JSON valid."}catch(e){$("configStatus").textContent="JSON tidak valid: "+e.message}};$("format").onclick=()=>{try{$("json").value=JSON.stringify(JSON.parse($("json").value),null,2);$("configStatus").textContent="JSON dirapikan."}catch(e){$("configStatus").textContent="JSON tidak valid."}};load()})();
</script></body></html>